==Battleground==
*20 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Pigeon de Sables are at a low enough magnification that as long as you dispose of them quickly, they won't become a threat. If one has any wave-immune units they can afford to spare, use them, as if you let the Pigeons stack up, they will shred your units to pieces.

